      "en": "离 relates two places by distance: 车站离这里远吗？ Do not copy English word order directly. 向 introduces direction; 左 is left and 右 is right. 一直走 instructs someone to go straight. Put the place of getting off after 在 and before 下车. 多长时间 asks about duration.",
