      "en": "虽然 introduces a concession and 但 the contrasting main point. Read both together: an increase is not complete proof of benefit. 而不是 contrasts interpretations. 不足以 means insufficient to justify or achieve something, not absolute impossibility. 在…之前 orders events. 还需要 expresses an additional need: more research is needed before generalising.",
